.TH EASE_OUT_QUAD 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
ease_out_quad \- Starts fast, slows to a stop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtween.h\(dq
.BI "float ease_out_quad(float t);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Starts fast, slows to a stop. The default choice for things arriving: a panel sliding in, a camera settling, a counter rolling up.
.SH RETURN VALUE
the eased value.
.SH MODULE
tween (src/engine/tween/tween.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ease_out_cubic (3),
.BR ease_in_quad (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
